{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "JOB",
 "chapter": 29,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.3",
   "range": "JOB.29.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "d658cd4a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.3#p1-c9dcb188",
     "text": "When I felt his favour.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "candle shined upon my head"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.3#p2-8016851c",
     "text": "I was free from affliction.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "darkness"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.4",
   "range": "JOB.29.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1a5e8b3f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.4#p1-1a5e8b3f",
     "text": "That is, seemed by evident tokens to be more present with me.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "secret of God was upon my"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.6",
   "range": "JOB.29.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0e68586a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.6#p1-0e68586a",
     "text": "By these comparisons he declares the great prosperity that he was in, so that he had no opportunity to be such a sinner as they accused him.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "with butter"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.8",
   "range": "JOB.29.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "3402ba86",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.8#p1-3402ba86",
     "text": "Being ashamed of their lightness and afraid of my gravity.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "hid themselves"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.9",
   "range": "JOB.29.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ddc63bdd",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.9#p1-ddc63bdd",
     "text": "Acknowledging my wisdom.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "mouth"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.11",
   "range": "JOB.29.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e3cbc0c3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.11#p1-e3cbc0c3",
     "text": "All that heard me, praised me.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "ear heard me"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.12",
   "range": "JOB.29.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "84fb132a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.12#p1-84fb132a",
     "text": "Because his adversaries did so much charge him with wickedness, he is compelled to render account of his life.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "poor that cried"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.13",
   "range": "JOB.29.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "12ec100d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.13#p1-12ec100d",
     "text": "That is, I helped him who was in distress, and so he had cause to praise me.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "The blessing of him that was"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.14",
   "range": "JOB.29.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7b8a0ddc",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.14#p1-7b8a0ddc",
     "text": "I delighted to do justice, as others did to wear costly apparel.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "righteousness"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.18",
   "range": "JOB.29.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0676e4b7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.18#p1-0676e4b7",
     "text": "That is, at home in my bed without all trouble and unquietness.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "nest"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.19",
   "range": "JOB.29.19",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6410b056",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.19#p1-6410b056",
     "text": "My happiness increases.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "spread out by the waters"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.22",
   "range": "JOB.29.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1c79dc98",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.22#p1-1c79dc98",
     "text": "That is, was pleasant to them.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "dropped upon them"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.23",
   "range": "JOB.29.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f2e3c49e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.23#p1-f2e3c49e",
     "text": "As the dry ground thirsts for the rain.",
     "label": "p",
     "anchor": "as for the latter rain"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.24",
   "range": "JOB.29.24",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b6920217",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.24#p1-ccca05f9",
     "text": "That is, they thought it not to be a rest, or they did not think that I would condescend to them.",
     "label": "q",
     "anchor": "laughed on them"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.24#p2-55e65286",
     "text": "They were afraid to offend me and cause me to be angry.",
     "label": "r",
     "anchor": "cast not down"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/JOB.29.25",
   "range": "JOB.29.25",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fc087bda",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/JOB.29.25#p1-fc087bda",
     "text": "I had them at commandment.",
     "label": "s",
     "anchor": "their way"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
